<title>UK: European precious metals end lower.</title>
<headline>European precious metals end lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $319.30/$319.80 vs $323.40/$323.90. Support around $322.00 eroded. Forecast to slip into lower range.</p>
<p>Pressure from strong dollar.</p>
<p>SILVER - Ended weaker at $4.39/$4.41 after attempting to fill $4.50-$4.55 gap.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Finished off at $447.00/$51.00 down $3.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Ended at $234.50/$237.50 down $1.10.</p>
</text>
